{{Quote|Transforms the user into a T-rex, granting powerful close ranged attacks.|Shop}}
'''T-Rex''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,700,000}} or {{Robux|2,350}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

T-Rex fruit allows the user to transform into a horned {{w|Tyrannosaurus|Tyrannosaurus Rex}} covered in bones. In this form, the user can create green air blades, pull in opponents with a roar, summon meteors, and cause craters. While transformed, attacks can inflict heavy bleeding on enemies, and running exacerbates the health loss when fighting against a T-Rex.

